      "explanation": "$$\\begin{gathered}x>0,\\ f(x - 1)<0\\Rightarrow 1<x<3\\\\x<0,\\ f(x - 1)>0\\Rightarrow -1<x<0\\\\x - 1=0\\Rightarrow x=1:\\ 0\\notin D\\text{ 时 }f(0)\\text{ 无意义}\\text{；}0\\in D\\text{ 时 }f(0)=0\\text{，不是解}\\\\\\frac{f(x-1)}{x}<0\\text{ 的解集为 }\\left(-1, 0\\right) \\cup \\left(1, 3\\right)\\end{gathered}$$",
      "highlight": {
        "caption": "解出各种情况，写出解集",
        "connector": "⇒",
        "items": [
